  {
   "id": "w6",
   "stage": "sew",
   "title": "Attach the webbing handles",
   "text": "Mark two lines on the body, each a quarter of the length in from the ends. Pin a webbing loop along each line, running across the bottom and up both sides, handles left free above the body. Edgestitch both edges of the webbing and box-stitch with an X where the stitching stops at the top.",
